      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CYCLONE SEBAS (5) comes off a quick 17.38 placing at this track over 300m. Rates a top chance again if runs up to latest. AWESOME RETURN (6) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing sixth (17.76) at this track latest. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Cannot be taken lightly. FUN EFFECTS (3) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 1.75 lengths at this track in a handy 17.44 beating My Julia. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. JUST A JOY (1) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
